# NAJIK mobile UI

## Design
- Match provided mockups and PDFs same-to-same (layout, spacing, forest green, official N+house+pin logo). Brand is **NAJIK**, never "Nepal Local".
- Login: large logo + tagline on white, then 7 service icons, then Nepal skyline/pagoda, then the login card overlapping the skyline.

## Keyboard
Never let the keypad cover inputs or buttons. Every form/screen with TextInput must use `KeyboardScreen` (`apps/mobile/src/components/KeyboardScreen.tsx`):
- `KeyboardAvoidingView` + `ScrollView` with `automaticallyAdjustKeyboardInsets`
- extra bottom padding equal to keyboard height
- `onFocus` scrolls the focused field into view
- Android `softwareKeyboardLayoutMode` is `resize` in `app.json`

## Taps
Buttons and tabs switch instantly. Do not use spring/scale press animations, screen-transition animations, or a loading spinner that delays navigation.

## Account types
The mockup **Login** screen is the common sign-in for buyers and sellers (logo, 7 icons, skyline, Google / Apple / phone card). After **manual logout**, open this Login page — not Welcome.
- **Create an account** on Login opens the User vs Service Provider choice, then the matching create form.
- **User** (buyer): create form (name, phone, password) → OTP (`1234`) → Login → app. Same phone/email cannot also be a seller.
- **Service Provider** (seller): create form (name, phone, password) → OTP → KYC apply form. Status is **pending** until admin verifies. They cannot post until verified. Approved listings appear in the buyer feed; pending listings wait in `/admin/listing-queue`.
Admin frontend queues: `/admin/providers` (KYC), `/admin/listing-queue` (listings)
